WEBVTT

00:08.097 --> 00:09.387
<b>♪</b>

00:11.307 --> 00:13.357
<b>[SITARA (ADULT)]
In the distant past,</b>

00:13.397 --> 00:16.487
<b>scholars used geometry
to establish the size</b>

00:16.527 --> 00:18.897
<b>and scope of Earth
for the first time.</b>

00:20.277 --> 00:21.777
<b>In which case,</b>

00:21.907 --> 00:25.327
<b>could one also use geometry
to determine the size and scope</b>

00:25.367 --> 00:27.867
<b>of the fate we hold
in our very hands?</b>

00:28.287 --> 00:31.667
<b>This is the story of a witch
who made a vast,</b>

00:31.707 --> 00:34.957
<b>expansive continent
into her plaything.</b>

00:34.997 --> 00:37.457
<b>♪</b>

00:53.477 --> 00:54.897
<b>[Sitara pants]</b>

00:57.357 --> 00:58.607
<b>[Ahmad groans]</b>

01:00.487 --> 01:03.317
<b>[Muslim prayer call
in the distance]</b>

01:24.717 --> 01:26.557
<b>[Ahmad gasps, grunts]</b>

01:26.597 --> 01:28.467
<b>[Sitara
continues panting]</b>

01:33.017 --> 01:34.267
<b>[Pigeons cooing]</b>

01:35.187 --> 01:36.437
<b>[Sitara gasps]</b>

01:37.357 --> 01:40.027
<b>[Muslim prayer call
continues]</b>

01:43.647 --> 01:45.027
<b>[gasps]</b>

01:48.907 --> 01:52.117
<b>[AHMAD] Where are you trying
to fly to, my little bird?</b>

01:52.157 --> 01:53.537
<b>[exclaims]</b>

01:54.367 --> 01:56.667
<b>You're quite a handful, child!</b>

02:02.257 --> 02:04.127
<b>♪</b>

02:11.057 --> 02:12.727
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

02:12.767 --> 02:14.057
<b>♪</b>

02:31.497 --> 02:33.197
<b>I love the bazaar here.</b>

02:33.247 --> 02:35.157
<b>It is so full of life.</b>

02:35.207 --> 02:37.207
<b>Mistress, once your iddah</b>

02:37.247 --> 02:39.667
<b>for the late master is over,
we'll go to the shops.</b>

02:39.707 --> 02:41.457
<b>Yes, let's.</b>

02:41.507 --> 02:43.877
<b>But today, I just hope
Allah will guide the way</b>

02:43.917 --> 02:45.877
<b>and lead us
to find a fine slave.</b>

02:45.927 --> 02:47.887
<b>-Uh?
-Not as fine as you, though.</b>

02:47.927 --> 02:49.637
<b>[Fatima and Zumurrud laugh]</b>

02:49.677 --> 02:51.217
<b>[indistinct chatter]</b>

02:54.227 --> 02:55.887
<b>[FATIMA] Hmm...</b>

02:55.937 --> 02:58.187
<b>Each one of them
is a hard worker.</b>

02:58.227 --> 02:59.437
<b>[FATIMA] Hm.</b>

02:59.477 --> 03:02.027
<b>This woman can cook up any meal
you desire,</b>

03:02.067 --> 03:03.277
<b>for example.</b>

03:03.357 --> 03:04.987
<b>-She's a great seamstress.
-Hm. Hm.</b>

03:05.027 --> 03:07.527
<b>And this one here
has the gift of gab.</b>

03:07.567 --> 03:09.987
<b>What a perfect
conversation partner, right?</b>

03:10.027 --> 03:11.237
<b>Well, perhaps.</b>

03:11.447 --> 03:13.787
<b>But what we need help
with the most right now is...</b>

03:13.827 --> 03:14.827
<b>Is housecleaning.</b>

03:14.867 --> 03:15.867
<b>That huge mansion</b>

03:15.907 --> 03:17.457
<b>is just too much
for me to handle!</b>

03:17.497 --> 03:20.377
<b>Indeed, and I still haven't
finished sorting</b>

03:20.417 --> 03:22.087
<b>all my late husband's
belongings.</b>

03:22.127 --> 03:23.297
<b>[AHMAD] Ah, say no more!</b>

03:23.337 --> 03:25.797
<b>What do you think
about this woman, then?</b>

03:25.837 --> 03:28.217
<b>There's no one can clean
the way she does!</b>

03:28.547 --> 03:30.297
<b>Hello, my name is Anis!</b>

03:30.347 --> 03:32.717
<b>Cleaning isn't about
what you feel like discarding,</b>

03:32.757 --> 03:34.017
<b>but what you wish to keep!</b>

03:34.637 --> 03:37.387
<b>Your days will be neat and tidy,
I give you my word!</b>

03:37.437 --> 03:40.057
<b>That is wonderful!
How much would she be?</b>

03:41.267 --> 03:43.267
<b>I'll let you have her
for 800 dirham.</b>

03:43.317 --> 03:46.607
<b>[gasps] I know that slaves
are expensive, but my goodness.</b>

03:46.647 --> 03:48.357
<b>Oh, please, Mr. Ahmad!</b>

03:48.407 --> 03:50.277
<b>Isn't there any way
you could go lower?</b>

03:50.817 --> 03:52.117
<b>[AHMAD] Mmm...</b>

03:52.157 --> 03:54.997
<b>Normally, I would refuse
a request like that.</b>

03:55.237 --> 03:56.947
<b>Just this one time, though.</b>

03:56.997 --> 03:59.077
<b>I will let you have her
for only half price!</b>

03:59.117 --> 04:00.127
<b>[Fatima and Zumurrud gasp]</b>

04:00.207 --> 04:03.207
<b>But in return for this...
Come here.</b>

04:03.247 --> 04:04.587
<b>[FATIMA AND ZUMURRUD] Huh?</b>

04:06.587 --> 04:07.757
<b>[SITARA] Uh?</b>

04:12.387 --> 04:14.257
<b>[AHMAD] Now go on.
Do as I taught you.</b>

04:14.677 --> 04:15.927
<b>[Sitara chuckles]</b>

04:15.967 --> 04:17.347
<b>Oh, how cute!</b>

04:17.387 --> 04:18.477
<b>And who is she?</b>

04:18.557 --> 04:21.397
<b>Her name's Sitara,
and I just acquired her.</b>

04:21.437 --> 04:23.977
<b>Oh, your name's
meaning is "star."</b>

04:24.017 --> 04:26.357
<b>-That's so lovely!
-[Sitara chuckles]</b>

04:26.397 --> 04:28.107
<b>[Ahmad clears throat]</b>

04:29.067 --> 04:31.317
<b>Although she may just be
a little bashful,</b>

04:31.357 --> 04:33.737
<b>her smile is quite fetching,
as you can see!</b>

04:33.777 --> 04:36.197
<b>And if she were given
a proper education,</b>

04:36.247 --> 04:39.457
<b>I think she could be a servant
to someone of high standing!</b>

04:39.497 --> 04:41.207
<b>So, here's what I'm proposing.</b>

04:41.247 --> 04:42.917
<b>-Lady Fatima...
-[FATIMA] Uh?</b>

04:42.957 --> 04:45.957
<b>Your household is known
for being rather scholarly,</b>

04:45.997 --> 04:48.207
<b>and Young Master Muhammad's
perceptive mind</b>

04:48.257 --> 04:50.087
<b>shines brightly
even here in Tus.</b>

04:50.127 --> 04:52.967
<b>So, studying with you
will give her real cachet!</b>

04:53.007 --> 04:55.847
<b>Might I trouble you to take her
into your home for a while?</b>

04:55.887 --> 04:57.387
<b>[FATIMA AND ZUMURRUD] Huh?</b>

05:02.097 --> 05:03.557
<b>-[UNCLE] What?
-[SITARA] Uh?</b>

05:03.607 --> 05:05.647
<b>You agreed to this?</b>

05:05.687 --> 05:07.187
<b>Oh, please.</b>

05:07.227 --> 05:09.317
<b>You're the only one
who's truly qualified</b>

05:09.357 --> 05:11.107
<b>to give her lessons now,
brother.</b>

05:11.147 --> 05:12.857
<b>I'm still fulfilling my iddah,</b>

05:12.907 --> 05:14.567
<b>and you're
the best teacher I know.</b>

05:14.617 --> 05:17.657
<b>As you are aware,
whether you're a slave or not,</b>

05:17.697 --> 05:20.997
<b>every Muslim's duty
is to seek knowledge.</b>

05:21.827 --> 05:23.537
<b>I suppose.</b>

05:23.827 --> 05:25.037
<b>[Sitara chuckles]</b>

05:25.077 --> 05:27.917
<b>Recitation's the cornerstone
of learning.</b>

05:27.957 --> 05:29.707
<b>And the first step
on that journey</b>

05:29.757 --> 05:31.257
<b>is to recite the Quran
properly.</b>

05:31.297 --> 05:33.257
<b>So now I want you
to repeat after me.</b>

05:33.297 --> 05:34.297
<b>[SITARA] Hm?</b>

05:34.757 --> 05:36.467
<b>"In the mighty name of Allah,</b>

05:36.507 --> 05:39.807
<b>the Most Gracious,
and also the Most Merciful."</b>

05:42.387 --> 05:44.147
<b>Uh? Now it is your turn.</b>

05:44.187 --> 05:45.347
<b>[SITARA] Hmm?</b>

05:45.397 --> 05:48.227
<b>[UNCLE] Hmm? Well, go on.
Your turn.</b>

05:48.687 --> 05:49.897
<b>[Sitara chuckles]</b>

05:49.937 --> 05:50.987
<b>♪</b>

05:51.027 --> 05:51.987
<b>[bird chirping]</b>

05:52.027 --> 05:53.197
<b>It's hopeless.</b>

05:53.317 --> 05:56.157
<b>No matter how hard I try,
she sits and smiles,</b>

05:56.197 --> 05:58.737
<b>showing absolutely no interest
in learning at all.</b>

05:58.777 --> 06:00.867
<b>But I swore I'd take her in.</b>

06:00.907 --> 06:02.077
<b>[Sitara chuckles]</b>

06:02.117 --> 06:04.117
<b>You can keep the other slave.</b>

06:04.167 --> 06:05.577
<b>I'll repay the discount.</b>

06:05.627 --> 06:07.667
<b>I hope you'll forgive me,
brother.</b>

06:07.997 --> 06:09.087
<b>[Uncle sighs]</b>

06:10.007 --> 06:12.217
<b>-[SITARA] Hmm?
-I'll have him come get you.</b>

06:12.257 --> 06:14.047
<b>-Just wait here, all right?
-[SITARA] Hm. Hm.</b>

06:14.627 --> 06:17.677
<b>[UNCLE] No, I'll go.
Mr. Ahmad's establishment, yes?</b>

06:17.717 --> 06:19.557
<b>[FATIMA] Yes. I'm so sorry.</b>

06:24.887 --> 06:26.767
<b>[SITARA]
Here's my chance!</b>

06:27.187 --> 06:30.937
<b>If I don't leave, who knows
where I'll get sold off to?</b>

06:30.977 --> 06:32.647
<b>I need to go home!</b>

06:32.737 --> 06:34.737
<b>♪</b>

06:42.197 --> 06:44.657
<b>[man grunts]</b>

06:48.877 --> 06:50.047
<b>[Sitara gasps]</b>

06:50.087 --> 06:52.087
<b>[Zumurrud humming]</b>

06:56.007 --> 06:57.427
<b>Find her?</b>

06:57.467 --> 06:58.587
<b>[ZUMURRUD] Mm-mm.</b>

06:58.757 --> 07:00.677
<b>[Uncle sighs]</b>

07:04.387 --> 07:06.887
<b>[Sitara gasps]
I'm so lost!</b>

07:06.937 --> 07:08.477
<b>How do I get out of here?</b>

07:15.357 --> 07:17.277
<b>[SITARA]
Can't let him see me.</b>

07:24.407 --> 07:25.447
<b>[Sitara gasps]</b>

07:25.657 --> 07:28.377
<b>And Young Master Muhammad's
perceptive mind</b>

07:28.417 --> 07:30.667
<b>shines brightly
even here in Tus.</b>

07:32.087 --> 07:33.417
<b>[MUHAMMAD] Uh?</b>

07:34.127 --> 07:35.337
<b>[SITARA] Excuse me.</b>

07:35.377 --> 07:36.587
<b>Uh, where is the door?</b>

07:36.627 --> 07:38.837
<b>Hey! This is most improper!</b>

07:38.887 --> 07:41.007
<b>Don't you know that
a woman must not ever reveal</b>

07:41.047 --> 07:42.807
<b>her uncovered hair to a man?</b>

07:42.847 --> 07:45.977
<b>[chuckles] It's all right,
'cause I'm still little!</b>

07:46.017 --> 07:47.267
<b>You're too close.</b>

07:47.597 --> 07:50.227
<b>And besides, it looks to me
like you're still a child, too,</b>

07:50.267 --> 07:51.687
<b>Young Master Muhammad!</b>

07:51.727 --> 07:53.517
<b>So, um, who are you?</b>

07:53.937 --> 07:55.737
<b>-My name is-- [gasps]
-[ZUMURRUD] Ah-ha!</b>

07:55.777 --> 07:57.027
<b>Since you up and disappeared,</b>

07:57.067 --> 07:58.947
<b>I've been looking
all over the place for you!</b>

07:58.987 --> 08:02.237
<b>Mm. The roses were so pretty,
I had to see them!</b>

08:02.277 --> 08:04.287
<b>Actually, she was looking
for the way out.</b>

08:04.327 --> 08:05.697
<b>[Sitara grunts]</b>

08:07.247 --> 08:08.787
<b>Unbelievable!</b>

08:08.827 --> 08:10.327
<b>How could you try to escape?</b>

08:10.377 --> 08:11.417
<b>Now, now there.</b>

08:11.457 --> 08:12.917
<b>In only a few moments,</b>

08:12.957 --> 08:15.127
<b>my brother will be back here
with Mr. Ahmad.</b>

08:15.167 --> 08:16.167
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

08:16.207 --> 08:18.217
<b>Didn't you want to go back?</b>

08:20.087 --> 08:22.797
<b>No, not back
to that man's place.</b>

08:22.847 --> 08:25.597
<b>To the house where
my mother and I used to live.</b>

08:26.097 --> 08:27.597
<b>Soon after she died,</b>

08:27.637 --> 08:29.847
<b>her master sold me off
to the highest bidder.</b>

08:29.887 --> 08:31.477
<b>-[Fatima gasps]
-Then that isn't your house,</b>

08:31.517 --> 08:32.477
<b>so there's no point!</b>

08:32.517 --> 08:34.317
<b>Remember, you're a slave!</b>

08:34.357 --> 08:36.437
<b>If you want a real home
worth returning to,</b>

08:36.487 --> 08:38.937
<b>study hard, so you'll be bought
by a good master!</b>

08:38.987 --> 08:40.817
<b>No! I don't ever want to study!</b>

08:40.857 --> 08:43.737
<b>And I won't be making
cute faces anymore, either,</b>

08:43.777 --> 08:46.497
<b>because it only makes me seem
more valuable to them!</b>

08:46.527 --> 08:48.577
<b>[cries] If I learn,
I'll just be sold again</b>

08:48.617 --> 08:50.207
<b>and taken away forever.</b>

08:50.707 --> 08:53.787
<b>I'm sick of going places
where I don't recognize things!</b>

08:53.837 --> 08:55.627
<b>[cries]</b>

08:56.417 --> 08:58.757
<b>[MUHAMMAD] Little girl.
I mean, Sitara,</b>

08:58.797 --> 09:01.007
<b>is that the reason
you came here to study?</b>

09:01.047 --> 09:02.047
<b>[SITARA] Uh?</b>

09:02.587 --> 09:05.507
<b>Even though our lots in life
might seem fairly different...</b>

09:05.547 --> 09:06.847
<b>Say, Zumurrud?</b>

09:07.467 --> 09:10.557
<b>Will you go and fetch me
a water bucket from the kitchen?</b>

09:10.597 --> 09:12.227
<b>A large one please.</b>

09:12.267 --> 09:13.687
<b>[ZUMURRUD] Yes, of course.</b>

09:13.727 --> 09:14.937
<b>[MUHAMMAD]
Come with me.</b>

09:14.977 --> 09:16.267
<b>[SITARA] Huh?</b>

09:17.897 --> 09:19.647
<b>Where are we going?</b>

09:22.607 --> 09:24.027
<b>[Muhammad chuckles]</b>

09:24.067 --> 09:25.237
<b>Up here?</b>

09:32.247 --> 09:34.327
<b>Will this one here be all right?</b>

09:34.377 --> 09:36.707
<b>Mm-hmm. Thanks so much.</b>

09:38.417 --> 09:40.877
<b>I'll be dropping it
in the courtyard.</b>

09:41.467 --> 09:42.547
<b>[BOTH] Huh?</b>

09:44.047 --> 09:46.427
<b>[Muhammad grunting]</b>

09:47.137 --> 09:48.347
<b>Young master, why?</b>

09:48.427 --> 09:50.267
<b>Do you really think
the girl is a lost cause?</b>

09:50.307 --> 09:51.677
<b>-[loud clang]
-[both yelp]</b>

09:51.727 --> 09:54.517
<b>[AHMAD] What on Earth was that?
Oh, my goodness!</b>

09:54.557 --> 09:56.937
<b>What's going on?</b>

10:01.067 --> 10:02.607
<b>[BOTH] Huh?</b>

10:02.647 --> 10:04.487
<b>[UNCLE] Is everyone all right?
What was that?</b>

10:04.527 --> 10:06.487
<b>Wait... Did lightning strike
the house?</b>

10:06.527 --> 10:09.077
<b>Are... are you sure
those barbarous nomads</b>

10:09.117 --> 10:11.657
<b>haven't started attacking us?
[whimpers]</b>

10:12.457 --> 10:13.657
<b>[Uncle gasps]</b>

10:13.707 --> 10:15.707
<b>-[Muhammad laughs]
-[UNCLE] A water bucket?</b>

10:15.747 --> 10:17.587
<b>Everyone down there
was so afraid.</b>

10:17.627 --> 10:20.047
<b>Young Master, your little prank
went too far!</b>

10:20.087 --> 10:21.797
<b>Just out of curiosity,</b>

10:21.837 --> 10:23.757
<b>why are you two
so calm and composed?</b>

10:23.797 --> 10:25.507
<b>Well, why wouldn't we be?</b>

10:25.967 --> 10:27.757
<b>We knew you were
about to drop it,</b>

10:27.797 --> 10:29.467
<b>and both of us covered our ears.</b>

10:32.227 --> 10:33.847
<b>So what you're telling me is,</b>

10:33.887 --> 10:35.807
<b>you both predicted
a future in which</b>

10:35.847 --> 10:37.187
<b>there would be a loud noise,</b>

10:37.227 --> 10:39.687
<b>then you took some precautions.
That about right?</b>

10:39.727 --> 10:42.357
<b>Well, yes. I suppose so.</b>

10:43.437 --> 10:44.897
<b>Then, just maybe</b>

10:44.947 --> 10:46.907
<b>that's what
learning's all about.</b>

10:46.947 --> 10:48.407
<b>[Sitara gasps softly]</b>

10:48.447 --> 10:49.617
<b>[MUHAMMAD]
At the moment,</b>

10:49.657 --> 10:51.827
<b>you don't have
any idea where you are,</b>

10:51.867 --> 10:55.157
<b>what's happening here,
or what is to become of you.</b>

10:55.207 --> 10:57.207
<b>It's all so unknown.</b>

10:57.247 --> 10:59.087
<b>My uncles
and the ones down there</b>

10:59.127 --> 11:00.707
<b>are in a similar situation.</b>

11:00.747 --> 11:03.127
<b>But if one were to study
and become wise,</b>

11:03.167 --> 11:05.217
<b>then one would know
the best course of action,</b>

11:05.257 --> 11:08.087
<b>no matter what the situation
might be. Always.</b>

11:08.637 --> 11:10.887
<b>And that could never be
a bad thing.</b>

11:11.307 --> 11:13.477
<b>Is that learning?</b>

11:16.557 --> 11:19.107
<b>-Uncle! I'm sorry about that!
-[ALL] Huh?</b>

11:19.147 --> 11:20.647
<b>It was me!</b>

11:20.687 --> 11:23.527
<b>[ANIS] Oh, this water bucket
is all bent now</b>

11:23.567 --> 11:25.027
<b>and won't stack anymore!</b>

11:25.067 --> 11:26.687
<b>How awful!</b>

11:26.737 --> 11:29.117
<b>[ZUMURRUD] You can go
and have it repaired.</b>

11:29.157 --> 11:31.197
<b>I'll make sure
all the cooking is done.</b>

11:31.277 --> 11:33.117
<b>Ah! Hello there!</b>

11:33.617 --> 11:34.787
<b>[SITARA] Mm?</b>

11:35.117 --> 11:37.907
<b>If you ever have any questions,
feel free to ask me.</b>

11:37.957 --> 11:39.037
<b>[SITARA] I will.</b>

11:39.957 --> 11:41.707
<b>[SITARA (ADULT)]
With a new perspective.</b>

11:41.747 --> 11:44.837
<b>Sitara remained
and found herself serving</b>

11:44.877 --> 11:46.917
<b>in a scholarly household.</b>

11:48.217 --> 11:51.217
<b>[Fatima humming]</b>

12:53.527 --> 12:54.697
<b>[Sitara gasp excitedly]</b>

12:54.737 --> 12:56.907
<b>You're looking really beautiful,
Mistress!</b>

12:56.947 --> 12:58.407
<b>Oh, thank you!</b>

12:58.457 --> 13:00.497
<b>Although, I feel rather
self-conscious.</b>

13:00.537 --> 13:01.707
<b>Now don't you be silly!</b>

13:02.127 --> 13:05.377
<b>It's your first day going back
to the hammam after your iddah!</b>

13:05.417 --> 13:07.837
<b>So, go have some fun.
Put on a little makeup,</b>

13:07.877 --> 13:09.547
<b>dye your hair
and hands with henna,</b>

13:09.587 --> 13:12.467
<b>and start chatting up a storm
with all the other wives there!</b>

13:12.507 --> 13:14.177
<b>Very well.</b>

13:14.887 --> 13:17.007
<b>I'll bring you with me someday.</b>

13:17.767 --> 13:18.977
<b>Sitara.</b>

13:19.427 --> 13:20.557
<b>Great!</b>

13:23.227 --> 13:26.437
<b>"And to Allah belongs
all that is in the heavens,</b>

13:26.477 --> 13:29.067
<b>and all that is in the Earth."</b>

13:30.317 --> 13:33.567
<b>My recitation is still different
than Uncle's somehow.</b>

13:33.617 --> 13:35.617
<b>I should have him
teach me again.</b>

13:36.117 --> 13:37.617
<b>[MUHAMMAD]
Mother, can we talk?</b>

13:37.657 --> 13:39.577
<b>[yelps] Uh, where is she?</b>

13:39.617 --> 13:41.537
<b>[SITARA] Mistress Fatima
left for the hammam</b>

13:41.577 --> 13:43.077
<b>a little while ago.</b>

13:43.287 --> 13:44.747
<b>I thought she told you.</b>

13:44.787 --> 13:47.247
<b>She did?
I forgot that was today.</b>

13:47.287 --> 13:49.457
<b>Does this mean you only have
enough room up there</b>

13:49.507 --> 13:50.917
<b>for your studies?</b>

13:50.967 --> 13:52.507
<b>As I have told you before,</b>

13:52.547 --> 13:54.967
<b>please don't leave your room
with your hair uncovered.</b>

13:55.007 --> 13:58.177
<b>And as I've told you,
I'm still a little girl!</b>

13:58.557 --> 14:01.177
<b>Besides, you're still only 12,
Young Master Muhammad.</b>

14:01.227 --> 14:04.267
<b>What's so bad about somebody
who can't grow a beard</b>

14:04.307 --> 14:06.187
<b>setting foot in a girl's room?</b>

14:06.227 --> 14:08.107
<b>I am not a child!</b>

14:08.147 --> 14:09.187
<b>[Sitara laughs]</b>

14:09.227 --> 14:11.147
<b>Am I immature in your eyes
as well?</b>

14:11.187 --> 14:12.187
<b>[SITARA] Huh?</b>

14:12.237 --> 14:13.397
<b>[Muhammad sighs]</b>

14:17.777 --> 14:19.577
<b>[MUHAMMAD]
My teacher said I'm too ignorant</b>

14:19.617 --> 14:21.407
<b>in the ways of the world.</b>

14:21.447 --> 14:23.537
<b>[SITARA] Do you mean
the one who teaches law?</b>

14:23.577 --> 14:25.247
<b>[MUHAMMAD]
Yes, Ustad Kamal al-Din,</b>

14:25.287 --> 14:28.247
<b>whom Father introduced me to
before he died.</b>

14:28.287 --> 14:29.957
<b>But recently though,</b>

14:29.997 --> 14:33.127
<b>I've sensed that we both have
very different views.</b>

14:33.337 --> 14:35.007
<b>He doesn't even give
clear answers</b>

14:35.047 --> 14:36.887
<b>to certain questions
I pose to him.</b>

14:36.927 --> 14:39.177
<b>You have
far too little experience</b>

14:39.217 --> 14:41.427
<b>to truly comprehend such things.</b>

14:43.517 --> 14:46.727
<b>That's why I'm leaving here
on a journey.</b>

14:46.767 --> 14:48.017
<b>[Sitara gasps]</b>

14:48.357 --> 14:51.567
<b>I want to travel to Nishapur
and visit its renowned teachers.</b>

14:51.607 --> 14:55.397
<b>But eventually, I'll explore
many other cities as well,</b>

14:55.447 --> 14:59.737
<b>and engage with wisdom
from any and all sources...</b>

15:00.237 --> 15:02.407
<b>Searching for truth!</b>

15:06.287 --> 15:08.127
<b>My father was a scholar,</b>

15:08.167 --> 15:10.667
<b>and I believe that's the path
he wanted for me.</b>

15:10.707 --> 15:11.757
<b>[Sitara exhales]</b>

15:15.467 --> 15:16.837
<b>How wonderful!</b>

15:16.887 --> 15:19.797
<b>Well, I have some washing to do,
so I need to go.</b>

15:19.847 --> 15:20.887
<b>Sure.</b>

15:24.137 --> 15:25.677
<b>[SITARA]
"And to Allah belongs</b>

15:25.727 --> 15:28.857
<b>all that is in the heavens
and all that is in the Earth."</b>

15:31.977 --> 15:34.897
<b>It seems like no matter
how hard I study,</b>

15:34.937 --> 15:38.107
<b>I'll never be able
to match Master Muhammad.</b>

15:41.197 --> 15:44.247
<b>[rooster crows]</b>

15:47.827 --> 15:49.497
<b>♪</b>

15:52.957 --> 15:54.707
<b>Farewell, Mother.
I'm leaving now.</b>

15:54.757 --> 15:57.507
<b>To not bring shame
upon your dear father,</b>

15:57.547 --> 15:59.177
<b>devote yourself to your studies.</b>

15:59.217 --> 16:00.217
<b>I will.</b>

16:00.297 --> 16:02.597
<b>Take good care of yourself.
[sniffles]</b>

16:06.057 --> 16:08.137
<b>As-salamu alaykum.</b>

16:08.177 --> 16:10.227
<b>[in English]
I will see you partway there.</b>

16:10.267 --> 16:12.057
<b>Thank you for all this, Uncle.</b>

16:12.437 --> 16:13.727
<b>[gasps softly]</b>

16:14.317 --> 16:15.527
<b>Hold on.</b>

16:15.567 --> 16:16.687
<b>Girl...</b>

16:16.737 --> 16:17.777
<b>[SITARA] Hmm?</b>

16:17.987 --> 16:19.777
<b>So, I've been told
that you still can't read.</b>

16:19.817 --> 16:20.987
<b>No.</b>

16:21.197 --> 16:22.447
<b>-Well, then...
-Uh?</b>

16:22.487 --> 16:24.527
<b>-I will be writing you letters.
-[gasps]</b>

16:24.577 --> 16:26.247
<b>So when I become a teacher,</b>

16:26.287 --> 16:27.957
<b>I'll know how to convey
my lessons</b>

16:27.997 --> 16:29.367
<b>to young children like you.</b>

16:29.407 --> 16:31.077
<b>And I'll write as simply
as I can.</b>

16:31.127 --> 16:33.167
<b>-That good?
-I'm practice?</b>

16:33.207 --> 16:34.747
<b>There is one thing I ask of you.</b>

16:34.797 --> 16:36.797
<b>Please study and read them
to Mother.</b>

16:36.837 --> 16:38.507
<b>Do you understand, Sitara?</b>

16:38.547 --> 16:39.797
<b>[Sitara gasps]</b>

16:39.967 --> 16:42.297
<b>No matter what, don't ever
stop learning, all right?</b>

16:42.347 --> 16:43.967
<b>I won't. I promise.</b>

16:44.967 --> 16:46.387
<b>And now I'm off.</b>

16:52.477 --> 16:55.107
<b>[SITARA (ADULT)] Muhammad,
a boy hailing from Tus,</b>

16:55.147 --> 16:57.567
<b>who would become
a renowned scholar.</b>

16:57.607 --> 17:01.027
<b>And Sitara,
a little slave girl...</b>

17:01.067 --> 17:02.867
<b>This would be
the very last time</b>

17:02.907 --> 17:06.197
<b>they ever saw each other
face to face.</b>

17:06.867 --> 17:08.327
<b>-[hooves clopping]
-[horse snorts]</b>

17:10.327 --> 17:11.457
<b>[SITARA] "In the name of Allah,</b>

17:11.497 --> 17:13.877
<b>the Most Gracious,
the Most Merciful."</b>

17:13.917 --> 17:15.167
<b>Uh?</b>

17:18.297 --> 17:20.007
<b>[ZUMURRUD] It's the Tus militia.</b>

17:20.047 --> 17:21.547
<b>Ms. Zumurrud?</b>

17:21.587 --> 17:24.257
<b>I bet they're on their way
to go scouting outside the city.</b>

17:24.847 --> 17:26.177
<b>From what I've been told,</b>

17:26.217 --> 17:28.807
<b>armed nomads have been
appearing in the area.</b>

17:30.017 --> 17:32.597
<b>My brother is down there
with them, somewhere.</b>

17:32.637 --> 17:35.057
<b>Though, I haven't seen him
in ages.</b>

17:35.107 --> 17:36.107
<b>[SITARA] Huh?</b>

17:36.147 --> 17:37.397
<b>Mikhail and I were born</b>

17:37.437 --> 17:39.737
<b>in a distant land
far to the west.</b>

17:40.397 --> 17:42.647
<b>Right on the sea!
And when the sun set,</b>

17:42.697 --> 17:45.367
<b>it turned everything
into a lovely purple!</b>

17:45.407 --> 17:46.487
<b>[SITARA] Really?</b>

17:46.527 --> 17:47.657
<b>We were both poor,</b>

17:47.697 --> 17:50.497
<b>but I still loved
watching the sea!</b>

17:50.867 --> 17:52.407
<b>-[FATIMA] Sitara?
-[SITARA] Uh?</b>

17:52.457 --> 17:54.707
<b>Could I trouble you
to read this letter?</b>

17:54.747 --> 17:56.877
<b>Yes! Of course!</b>

17:56.917 --> 17:58.797
<b>In the usual room, right?</b>

17:58.837 --> 18:01.457
<b>My goodness!
Look at how happy she is!</b>

18:01.507 --> 18:02.757
<b>[Fatima laughs]</b>

18:03.337 --> 18:04.637
<b>All right. So,</b>

18:04.677 --> 18:08.257
<b>"Mom, Uncle,
In these past eight years,</b>

18:08.307 --> 18:10.427
<b>I've studied many fields
of learning,</b>

18:10.467 --> 18:13.437
<b>including philosophy,
medicine, and astronomy.</b>

18:13.807 --> 18:15.097
<b>[MUHAMMAD]
Nishapur is a sprawling,</b>

18:15.137 --> 18:18.067
<b>vibrant city where
many noted scholars gather.</b>

18:18.107 --> 18:21.607
<b>For example, I was instructed
by Farid al-Din Damad</b>

18:21.647 --> 18:24.237
<b>in the medical arts founded
by Ibn Sina.</b>

18:24.987 --> 18:26.067
<b>Unlike theology,</b>

18:26.367 --> 18:28.697
<b>in which one simply parrots
what one is taught,</b>

18:28.737 --> 18:30.947
<b>science is knowledge
that's built upon</b>

18:30.987 --> 18:32.907
<b>real-world experiences.</b>

18:32.957 --> 18:34.707
<b>[BOTH] I'm finding
this way of learning</b>

18:34.747 --> 18:36.247
<b>is far more agreeable.</b>

18:36.577 --> 18:37.707
<b>And also...</b>

18:37.747 --> 18:38.797
<b>[chuckles]</b>

18:38.997 --> 18:40.917
<b>...if our little star, Sitara,
would be open</b>

18:40.957 --> 18:42.207
<b>to learning about them,</b>

18:42.337 --> 18:44.667
<b>please see that she studies
the various postulates</b>

18:44.717 --> 18:46.967
<b>and theorems
of Euclid and Ptolemy."</b>

18:47.007 --> 18:48.217
<b>-Uh?
-[both chuckle]</b>

18:49.967 --> 18:51.557
<b>Come along with me.</b>

18:56.227 --> 18:58.107
<b>[Sitara exclaims]</b>

18:58.647 --> 19:01.147
<b>Can't believe you're showing me
all of these precious books.</b>

19:01.187 --> 19:02.607
<b>-Thanks!
-Of course.</b>

19:02.777 --> 19:06.947
<b>It's a duty upon each Muslim
to continue seeking knowledge.</b>

19:06.987 --> 19:09.907
<b>That's what my late
scholar husband had told me.</b>

19:09.947 --> 19:12.697
<b>"Euclid's Elements"
is that one right there.</b>

19:12.737 --> 19:14.247
<b>Great!</b>

19:14.787 --> 19:16.497
<b>[grunts]</b>

19:21.997 --> 19:24.837
<b>It says, "A point is that
which has no part."</b>

19:24.877 --> 19:26.927
<b>And that "a line
is breadthless length."</b>

19:26.967 --> 19:29.677
<b>Therefore, "The ends
of a line are points."</b>

19:29.717 --> 19:31.807
<b>It's like he's just stating
obvious things</b>

19:31.847 --> 19:33.807
<b>in a really complicated way.</b>

19:33.847 --> 19:36.477
<b>[FATIMA] But why do
obvious things seem so obvious?</b>

19:36.517 --> 19:38.857
<b>It's through amassing examples
one by one</b>

19:38.897 --> 19:41.567
<b>that we prove
universal principles. [chuckles]</b>

19:41.607 --> 19:42.817
<b>Still with me?</b>

19:42.857 --> 19:44.067
<b>I'm sorry,</b>

19:44.527 --> 19:47.147
<b>but I don't see how I'm supposed
to apply any of this knowledge.</b>

19:47.187 --> 19:50.777
<b>Well then, let's find
a more interesting one for you.</b>

19:50.827 --> 19:54.197
<b>Al-Biruni. Here's his book
on astrology.</b>

19:54.237 --> 19:55.747
<b>Astrology, huh?</b>

19:56.247 --> 19:57.617
<b>[FATIMA] This should be better.</b>

19:57.657 --> 20:00.167
<b>-Now, look at this.
-[gasps]</b>

20:00.787 --> 20:06.127
<b>"The diameter of the Earth
is 2,163 and one-third farsakh,</b>

20:06.167 --> 20:09.177
<b>and its circumference
is 6,800 farsakh."</b>

20:09.757 --> 20:12.557
<b>Do you mean he traveled
to the ends of the Earth?</b>

20:12.597 --> 20:15.057
<b>Oh, no, that would be
quite impossible.</b>

20:15.967 --> 20:19.057
<b>By forming a right triangle
using a spot on the ground,</b>

20:19.097 --> 20:21.437
<b>a mountaintop,
and the center of the Earth,</b>

20:21.477 --> 20:24.267
<b>it's then possible to determine
the Earth's radius.</b>

20:24.317 --> 20:26.357
<b>A mountaintop, huh?</b>

20:27.987 --> 20:29.947
<b>[FATIMA] There's yet
another method of calculating</b>

20:29.987 --> 20:32.407
<b>the Earth's circumference
using the angle of shadows</b>

20:32.447 --> 20:33.407
<b>on the ground.</b>

20:33.447 --> 20:35.157
<b>[SITARA] Just with shadows?</b>

20:36.287 --> 20:37.497
<b>[bucket clangs]</b>

20:37.537 --> 20:38.617
<b>[Sitara gasps]</b>

20:38.997 --> 20:40.497
<b>[FATIMA] All of these
were derived</b>

20:40.537 --> 20:43.417
<b>from the universal knowledge
that's found in Elements.</b>

20:43.457 --> 20:45.877
<b>Well? Is your interest piqued?</b>

20:45.917 --> 20:47.167
<b>[Sitara gasps softly]</b>

20:47.207 --> 20:49.087
<b>-[gasps] It's burning!
-[Sitara yelps]</b>

20:49.127 --> 20:51.137
<b>[exclaims]</b>

20:53.047 --> 20:54.757
<b>[chuckles nervously]</b>

20:54.807 --> 20:57.967
<b>It is one problem after another
with you lately.</b>

20:58.427 --> 21:00.597
<b>I hope you'll forgive me,
Ms. Anis.</b>

21:01.437 --> 21:02.977
<b>Now listen, Sitara.</b>

21:03.017 --> 21:06.027
<b>There are slaves
who do all sorts of jobs.</b>

21:06.067 --> 21:08.397
<b>There are even those who acquire
all kinds of knowledge</b>

21:08.437 --> 21:09.947
<b>to entertain their masters.</b>

21:09.987 --> 21:13.817
<b>And depending on the case,
some are promised their freedom.</b>

21:15.027 --> 21:16.157
<b>That said,</b>

21:16.277 --> 21:18.367
<b>you should never get
your hopes up too high.</b>

21:18.407 --> 21:22.037
<b>Because we are in no position
to decide such things.</b>

21:22.207 --> 21:24.087
<b>We're property, not people.</b>

21:24.127 --> 21:25.797
<b>-[UNCLE] Listen, girls.
-[BOTH] Huh?</b>

21:25.837 --> 21:27.457
<b>Gather 'round, please.</b>

21:27.837 --> 21:29.507
<b>Could you also fetch Zumurrud?</b>

21:29.547 --> 21:31.127
<b>Is there something wrong?</b>

21:31.167 --> 21:34.847
<b>Our militia fought,
but the nomads have won!</b>

21:34.887 --> 21:36.887
<b>♪</b>

21:39.017 --> 21:41.727
<b>[SITARA (ADULT)] Heaven didn't
answer our prayers with mercy.</b>

21:41.767 --> 21:43.687
<b>They were met only with fire.</b>

21:43.727 --> 21:46.977
<b>Instead of rain,
embers fell across the land,</b>

21:47.017 --> 21:48.397
<b>followed by silence...</b>

21:49.067 --> 21:51.357
<b>which took place of the flames.</b>

22:13.257 --> 22:15.887
<b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b>

23:43.017 --> 23:47.307
<b>[SITARA (ADULT)] Next episode:
"The Roses that Bloom in Safar."</b>
